                              UN/EDIFACT

                UNITED NATIONS STANDARD MESSAGE (UNSM)

                        Medical prescription request message

                                           Message Type : MEDREQ
                                           Version      : D
                                           Release      : 22A
                                           Contr. Agency: UN

Function: This message is used to request a medical prescription.
Note: Fixture note for MEDREQ.

